ADDING ITEMS TO INVENTORY:
Need to make an item instance with the key of the item, that represents the item.
If it is a more complicated item with more information than just the item's identity such as a pelt,
a custom ItemInstance child class is needed and the properties added there.
ItemDatabase holds UI needs like a display name and icon.
The most important part is the item instance key needs to match the item definition key.
The crutial step then is creating the item instance and making sure it makes sense.